From: vaibhaw1994kumar <vaibhaw01994@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:23:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add pre-funded spot inventory model to risk admission

- risk.inventory.model: unconstrained (default, legacy; labelled
  UNCONSTRAINED_SPOT_SHORTING_ALLOWED) or pre_funded with per-venue
  initial_base_by_venue and quote (default initial_capital_by_venue).
- In pre_funded mode a non-margin sell leg needs held base minus reserved
  base on the sell venue, and a buy leg needs held quote minus reserved
  quote. Held balances are opening + ledger fills (the OMS attaches its
  ledger to the risk engine). Margin-enabled venues keep margin checks.
- Reservations carry base_by_venue; capacity and run summaries report the
  inventory model, label and per-venue balances.
- 9 new tests (tests/test_spot_inventory.py); 249 tests pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
